# title: Outperformance option
# category: Multi-asset
# underlyings: 2
# source: Margrabe, The Value of an Option to Exchange One Asset for Another, Journal of Finance, 1978
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: Pays how much the first stock outperformed the second over the year, if it did.
#
# Notional 1000. spot(0) is the stock expected to outperform, spot(1) the
# benchmark. Its value rises as their correlation falls.

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot(0)
    s1 = spot(1)

2028-01-04
    pays 1000 * max(spot(0) / s0 - spot(1) / s1, 0)
